#
# File: 230-ARP-Announcement-req-out-monitor.rule
# Policy: Monitor RFC 5227 ARP announcement candidates for the zone interface address
# Description:
#     Runs after ARP hook and zone interface map/vmap dispatch; no interface matching here.
#     An announcement request uses equal sender and target IPv4 addresses.
#     Direction: local-to-remote; intended for arp output hook.
#
arp operation request arp saddr ip $ZONE_INTF_IPADDR arp daddr ip $ZONE_INTF_IPADDR counter comment "local-to-remote Announcement req monitor"
